{"chapter-slug":"rw8-13 F","paragraph":329,"wording":"[Boxer]","event":"named","holder-slug":"alber","holder-quote":"He exploded out with the punch, fast, using his reach and full body’s weight behind the blow. Fierre saw, with her ring, Alber’s class and level appear in her vision.","id":"3f4964ff-7fd8-5b4d-98e5-674bd6ee48dd"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw8-13 F","paragraph":340,"wording":"[Boxer]","event":"named","holder-slug":"alber","holder-quote":"Alber had used the same Skills in bout after bout.","id":"b8f2049c-bbde-5d03-a63f-6706b9309b9e"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw8-13 F","paragraph":358,"wording":"[Boxer]","event":"named","holder-slug":"alber","holder-quote":"Fierre saw the [Boxer] put up the cross-arm block as the bell rang. Garia leapt forwards, and it was a good step-in. She saw Alber’s eyes widen, but he had his arms making a cross, a strong punch-blocker. She raised her fist—","id":"50270763-37a4-5573-a9d1-8614e8bf9a53"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw8-13 F","paragraph":374,"wording":"[Boxer]","event":"named","holder-slug":"alber","holder-quote":"They’d had a drink afterwards, in the closest pub. Ironically, the [Tavern Diver] and his mates had wanted to haul Alber off, figuring that if you couldn’t beat him, the [Boxer] was their best friend, and possible second in a bar fight.","id":"df29111d-9b4d-54d5-b23f-90eff11a619d"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw8-13 F","paragraph":608,"wording":"[Boxer]","event":"named","holder-slug":"alber","holder-quote":"Alber was not. Fierre had heard from Wailant that the [Boxer] had fled the next morning after a single night there which involved eight boxing bouts against father and daughter.","id":"d7839bf9-dc19-592a-bf63-9418dc54519d"}
